## Skill handoffs (KitchenKin)

Use these KitchenKin repo skills **conditionally** based on what the user asks for and what files/surfaces are involved.

### Auth-aware changes (Better Auth)

When work touches sign-in, session, cookies, or `apps/web/src/app/api/auth/**`: **Better Auth** is on **`apps/web`** at **`/api/auth/*`**. Shared options in **`packages/auth/src/auth-options-core.ts`**; Next instance **`@kk/auth/next`** (adds `nextCookies()` last). Expo uses **`EXPO_PUBLIC_AUTH_ORIGIN`** and **`expoClient`** with SecureStore. REST route handlers use **`auth()`** from **`apps/web/auth.ts`**.

### REST API contract / design

Invoke `.cursor/skills/backend-rest-api-design/SKILL.md` when work includes:

- Adding/changing `/api` routes, request/response shapes, pagination, or auth requirements
- Designing new API contracts (even if not implementing yet)

Contract reference: **`docs/api.md`** + Zod in **`packages/shared/src/api/`**.

### Backend implementation (domain + Prisma + Redis)

Invoke `.cursor/skills/backend-impl-prisma-redis/SKILL.md` when work includes:

- Implementing/modifying **`@kk/domain`** services
- Prisma queries, pagination, transactional semantics
- Redis caching keys, invalidation, or consistency (auth or new domain caching)

### Frontend implementation (Next.js + TanStack Query)

Invoke `.cursor/skills/frontend-feature-implementation/SKILL.md` for **`apps/web`** UI routes/components.

Invoke `.cursor/skills/tanstack-query/SKILL.md` for client data fetching: `useInfiniteQuery`, SSR dehydrate, mobile cookies.

### Maintainability reviews

Invoke `.cursor/skills/code-review-maintainability/SKILL.md` for code review or refactor suggestions.

## Guardrails

- **`@kk/domain`** is server-only — never import from `"use client"` modules.
- Clients use **`@kk/shared`** `api-client` + per-app TanStack hooks in **`src/lib/query/hooks/`**.
- Order for full-stack features: **contract → domain → route handlers → UI**.
